# DRA-PUB-005 Publication-Governance Checksum Ledger
# Format: <sha256>  <path relative to repository root>
# Algorithm: SHA-256. Verify with: sha256sum -c DRA-PUB-005-CHECKSUMS.sha256 (run from repository root).
#
# Scope: this ledger records the SHA-256 of every file modified or newly created by
# DRA-PUB-005 (publication identity and governance closure), AS OF DRA-PUB-005.
#
# This ledger does NOT replace, edit, or invalidate docs/dra/DRA-PUB-004-CHECKSUMS.sha256.
# That file remains the correct historical record of what those files contained at the
# time DRA-PUB-004 was produced (2026-08-12). Two files below (DRA-CITATION.cff,
# DRA-PUBLIC-RELEASE-MANIFEST.md) also appear in the DRA-PUB-004 ledger with different
# (now-superseded-by-later-edit) digests -- that is expected and correct: it reflects the
# file's content at PUB-004 time, not a "wrong" checksum. Use THIS ledger for the current
# (post-PUB-005) content of those two files.
#
# The frozen scientific manuscript is unaffected by DRA-PUB-005 and is not repeated here;
# see docs/dra/DRA-PUB-004-CHECKSUMS.sha256 and docs/dra/DRA-PUB-005-REPORT.md Section 6
# for its independently-reverified digest.

